object, but he was too late.

00:18:56.668 --> 00:18:59.705
And so it got passed and
then it went to the House

00:18:59.705 --> 00:19:02.941 align:start size:97% position:3%
but he was mad 'cause we
passed it over his objection.

00:19:02.941 --> 00:19:05.043 align:start size:88% position:13%
So he got his buddies
in the House to stop it.

00:19:05.043 --> 00:19:07.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then when they
finally did get around to,

00:19:07.446 --> 00:19:09.681
they said, well, we're
really kind of for this.

00:19:09.681 --> 00:19:11.049
We kind of, maybe they do,

00:19:11.049 --> 00:19:13.185 align:start position:0%
but some dead people's
relatives could use this money.

00:19:13.185 --> 00:19:15.821
And so they did pass
it, but they said,

00:19:15.821 --> 00:19:18.090
we will only end the process

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:20.025
