people in three years.

00:19:20.025 --> 00:19:22.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
So this is how ineffective
your government is.

00:19:22.861 --> 00:19:25.964 align:start size:97% position:3%
They can't even immediately
end sending checks

00:19:25.964 --> 00:19:27.466 align:start size:84% position:16%
