00:19:31.336 --> 00:19:33.005 align:start size:88% position:13%
- I believe this is
what we call the swamp.

00:19:33.005 --> 00:19:35.207 align:start size:88% position:13%
All right, the other
piece that you're trying

00:19:35.207 --> 00:19:37.743 align:start size:97% position:3%
