00:20:03.602 --> 00:20:05.671 align:start size:84% position:16%
And so I think that
should be your choice.

00:20:05.671 --> 00:20:07.339
So this National
Right to Work law

00:20:07.339 --> 00:20:09.308
doesn't really add new law.

00:20:09.308 --> 00:20:10.242
You should like this.

00:20:10.242 --> 00:20:11.276
