00:20:43.775 --> 00:20:46.378
of collectively trying to gather

00:20:46.378 --> 00:20:47.779
to (indistinct) for something

00:20:47.779 --> 00:20:49.248 align:start size:84% position:16%
but I think you
should have a choice.

00:20:49.248 --> 00:20:51.550
- How has basically one

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:53.819
